{
  "case_id": "HCH02",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "items": [
    {"id": "HC02-D01", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipSetOn"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipSet"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.mem_LipSet_iff"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoefMat"}],
     "representation": "LipSetOn d φ U : Set (I→I→ENNReal) = {L | U ⊆ dom φ ∧ ∀x∈U ∀y∈U ∀j, d j (φx)(φy) ≤ Σ_i L i j * d i x y}；LipSet d φ = LipSetOn d φ (dom φ)。I 为 Fintype（有限），系数与距离都是 ENNReal，并采用 mathlib 的 0·⊤=0 约定。定义本身不要求度量公理与 Nonempty I；在扩展规范空间语境下直接代入即可。",
     "dependencies": []},
    {"id": "HC02-D02", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoLipSetOn"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.zero_mem_CoLipSetOn"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.update_top_mem_CoLipSetOn"}],
     "representation": "CoLipSetOn d φ U = {K | U.Nonempty ∧ U ⊆ dom φ ∧ ∀x,y∈U ∀j, Σ_i K i j * d i x y ≤ d j (φx)(φy)}，非空性与定义域条件都写在成员条件里。系数 0 合法见 zero_mem_CoLipSetOn；系数 ⊤ 合法（0·⊤=0）见 update_top_mem_CoLipSetOn。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01"]},
    {"id": "HC02-D03", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoefMat"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.toDisplay"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.toDisplay_apply"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.toDisplay_injective"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matComp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.toDisplay_matComp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.sum_matComp_mul"}],
     "representation": "CoefMat I := I→I→ENNReal 按输入优先存储，M i j = M_{i→j}。toDisplay M : Matrix I I ENNReal 满足 (toDisplay M) j i = M i j，即第 j 行第 i 列。matComp M₂ M₁ i j = Σ_k M₂ k j * M₁ i k；已证 toDisplay (matComp M₂ M₁) = toDisplay M₂ * toDisplay M₁（通常矩阵乘法），并证 toDisplay 为单射。",
     "dependencies": []},
    {"id": "HC02-D04", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.idMat"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.toDisplay_idMat"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matProd"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matProd_zero"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matProd_succ"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matProd_one"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.toDisplay_matProd"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matComp_idMat_right"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matComp_idMat_left"}],
     "representation": "idMat i j = if i=j then 1 else 0（δ_ij），其显示矩阵为 1。matProd L 0 = idMat（空乘积）；matProd L (k+1) = matComp (L k) (matProd L k)，因此 matProd L k = L_k⋯L_1（0 起下标）：施行顺序 φ_1,…,φ_k 对应左乘顺序。toDisplay_matProd 把它写成通常矩阵列表积 [L_k,…,L_1].prod；matProd_one 给出 k=1 时乘积等于 L 0。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D03"]},
    {"id": "HC02-D05", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.idOp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.opComp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.opComp_eq_operatorChain"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.mem_dom_opComp_iff"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.subset_dom_of_subset_dom_opComp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chainComp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chainComp_eq_operatorChain"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.imageSeq"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chainComp_image"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.dom_chainComp_anti"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.imageSeq_subset_dom"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.subset_dom_chainComp_of_le"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipChain"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoLipChain"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipChain.imageSeq_props"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoLipChain.imageSeq_props"}],
     "representation": "chainComp ϕ 0 = id，chainComp ϕ (k+1) = ϕ k ∘ chainComp ϕ k，即 c_k，并证明它等于第 1 章的 OperatorChain [φ_k,…,φ_1]。imageSeq ϕ U 0 = U，imageSeq ϕ U (m+1) = ϕ m '' imageSeq ϕ U m，即 U_{m+1}=φ_m(U_m)（0 起下标）。已证 c_m(U_1) = U_{m+1}（chainComp_image）；由 U_1 ⊆ dom c_k 得 m<k 时 U_m ⊆ dom φ_m（imageSeq_subset_dom）。LipChain/CoLipChain 的字段只有算子序列、逐步矩阵、起始域、U_1 ⊆ dom c_k 以及每步在实际 U_m 上的证书资格，不含最终复合界。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01", "HC02-D02"]},
    {"id": "HC02-D06", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.fullPath"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.fullPath_zero"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.fullPath_last"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.fullPath_succ_castSucc"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.fullPath_length_one"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.intermediate_length_one_unique"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.pathEdge"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.pathWeight"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.PathAllPos"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.PathHasZero"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.pathWeight_snoc"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.matProd_apply_eq_sum_paths"}],
     "representation": "n = m+1 层（n≥1）时，中间指标序列为任意 s : Fin m → I，不加正性约束。fullPath i j s : Fin (m+2) → I 满足 k_0=i、k_t=s_{t-1}、k_n=j。pathEdge 是第 t 层边 [M^{(t+1)}]_{k_t→k_{t+1}}，pathWeight 是各层边的乘积；PathAllPos 表示所有边>0，PathHasZero 表示某边=0。n=1 时 Fin 0 → I 只有一个空序列，路径为 ![i,j]。matProd_apply_eq_sum_paths 证明乘积条目等于全部路径权重之和。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D04"]},
    {"id": "HC02-D07", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Channel"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.RowSparse"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.RowSingle"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.ColSparse"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.ColSingle"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IsDiagonal"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.RowDecoupled"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.ColDecoupled"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.FullyDecoupledCert"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.rowSparse_iff_display"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.colSparse_iff_display"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.isDiagonal_iff_display"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.rowSingle_iff_atMostOne"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.colSingle_iff_atMostOne"}],
     "representation": "Channel I := I×I。RowSparse L i j := ∀k≠i, L k j = 0；RowSingle L j := ∃i RowSparse L i j；RowDecoupled d φ U j := ∃L∈LipSetOn d φ U, RowSingle L j。ColSparse L i j := ∀k≠j, L i k = 0；ColSingle、ColDecoupled 同理。IsDiagonal L := ∀ i≠j, L i j = 0。另证与显示矩阵的行、列、对角（Matrix.IsDiag）一致，并在 I 非空时证明 ∃i Row 等价于“第 j 行至多一项非零”（列同理）。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01", "HC02-D03"]},
    {"id": "HC02-D08", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chanFeasible"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chanLip"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.channelLip"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chanLip_eq_top_of_empty"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.chanLip_le_of_rowSparse"}],
     "representation": "chanFeasible d φ U i j = {c : ENNReal | ∀x∈U ∀y∈U, d j (φx)(φy) ≤ c * d i x y}（即 S_ij）；chanLip = sInf S_ij，并有 sInf ∅ = ⊤（chanLip_eq_top_of_empty）。原文把 U ⊆ dom φ 作为语境前提，这里的定义对任意 U 都成立。chanLip 与矩阵条目是两个独立对象，唯一证明的联系是：若 L 合法且第 j 行只在 i 处可能非零，则 chanLip ≤ L i j。",
     "dependencies": []},
    {"id": "HC02-P01", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipSetOn_single_iff"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipSet_single_iff"}],
     "representation": "I={i} 用假设 ∀k:I, k=i 表示。L 合法（受限或全域）当且仅当 ∀x,y, d i (φx)(φy) ≤ L i i * d i x y；这是等价式，比单向退化更强。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P02", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [{"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipSet_subset_lipSetOn"}],
     "representation": "U ⊆ dom φ → LipSet d φ ⊆ LipSetOn d φ U。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P03", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [{"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipSetOn_anti"}],
     "representation": "U ⊆ V → V ⊆ dom φ → LipSetOn d φ V ⊆ LipSetOn d φ U。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P04", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipEntryInf"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipEntryInf_mono"}],
     "representation": "lipEntryInf d φ U i j = sInf {M i j | M ∈ LipSetOn d φ U}；U ⊆ V ⊆ dom φ 时 a_ij(U) ≤ a_ij(V)。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-P03"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P05", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_comp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.subset_dom_of_subset_dom_opComp"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.sum_matComp_mul"}],
     "representation": "条件 U₁ ⊆ dom(opComp φ₂ φ₁)，U₂ = operator_image φ₁ U₁（第 1 章的像集），L₁ ∈ LipSetOn d φ₁ U₁，L₂ ∈ LipSetOn d φ₂ U₂；结论 matComp L₂ L₁ ∈ LipSetOn d (opComp φ₂ φ₁) U₁。另单独证明 U₂ ⊆ dom φ₂。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D01", "HC02-D03", "HC02-D05"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P06", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [{"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_entry_eq_zero_of_pair"}],
     "representation": "若 x,y ∈ dom φ，d j (φx)(φy) = 0 且 0 < d i x y，则 ∀K ∈ CoLipSetOn d φ (dom φ)，K i j = 0。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D02"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P07", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [{"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_comp"}],
     "representation": "实际像域设定与 P05 相同。K₁ ∈ CoLipSetOn d φ₁ U₁，K₂ ∈ CoLipSetOn d φ₂ (φ₁ '' U₁)，则 matComp K₂ K₁ ∈ CoLipSetOn d (φ₂∘φ₁) U₁；结论包含 U₁ 非空（取自 K₁）。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D02", "HC02-D03", "HC02-D05"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P08", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturb_forward"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturb_core"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.two_mul_eq_add_self"}],
     "representation": "语境：hd : ∀i ExtendedPseudoMetric X bot (d i)，U ⊆ dom φ₁ ∩ dom φ₂（即 dom(φ₁,φ₂)），δ : I → ENNReal，∀z∈U ∀j, d j (φ₁z)(φ₂z) ≤ δ j。结论：∀x,y∈U ∀j，d j(φ₂x)(φ₂y) ≤ d j(φ₁x)(φ₁y) + 2δ_j，并同时给出 +δ_j+δ_j 形式。",
     "dependencies": []},
    {"id": "HC02-P09", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturb_backward"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturb_symm"}],
     "representation": "前提与 P08 相同。结论 d j(φ₁x)(φ₁y) ≤ d j(φ₂x)(φ₂y) + 2δ_j（以及 +δ_j+δ_j 形式），由对称性交换 φ₁、φ₂ 得到。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-P08"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P10", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
