     "representation": "另设 L₁ ∈ LipSetOn d φ₁ U，则 d j(φ₂x)(φ₂y) ≤ Σ_i L₁ i j d i x y + 2δ_j。swap 版本对应原文“交换 φ₁,φ₂”：φ₂ 的证书控制 φ₁。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-P08", "HC02-P09"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P11", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturb_coLip_bridge"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturb_coLip_bridge_swap"}],
     "representation": "另设 K₁ ∈ CoLipSetOn d φ₁ U，则 Σ_i K₁ i j d i x y ≤ d j(φ₂x)(φ₂y) + 2δ_j；另给交换版本。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-P09", "HC02-P08"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P12", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipChain.prod_mem"},
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_matProd_mem"}],
     "representation": "C : LipChain bot d k，k ≥ 1：只要 U_1 ⊆ dom c_k 且 ∀m<k，L m ∈ LipSetOn d (φ m) (imageSeq … m)（实际 U_{m+1}），就有 matProd C.mats k（=L_k⋯L_1）∈ LipSetOn d (chainComp ops k) U_1。lip_matProd_mem 对所有 k（含 0）成立，证明对 k 归纳，使用 P05 与 P14。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-P05", "HC02-P14", "HC02-D05", "HC02-D04"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P13", "status": "complete",
