       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_matProd_mem_of_nonempty"}],
     "representation": "C : CoLipChain bot d k，k ≥ 1，每步 co-Lip 证书资格都含非空性；结论 K_k⋯K_1 ∈ CoLipSetOn d c_k U_1。U_1 非空由第 0 步证书取得，然后对 k 归纳。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-P07", "HC02-P15", "HC02-D05", "HC02-D04"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P14", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.idMat_mem_LipSetOn"},
