       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.sum_idMat_dist"}],
     "representation": "c_0 = chainComp ϕ 0 = idOp，空乘积 matProd L 0 = idMat。U ⊆ dom id 时 idMat ∈ LipSetOn d idOp U：这一条不需要非空性，强于原文。zero_step_certificate 给出原文的非空形式，结论落在 Lip 与 co-Lip 证书族的交集中。",
     "dependencies": ["HC02-D04", "HC02-D05"]},
    {"id": "HC02-P15", "status": "complete",
     "declarations": [
       {"file": "Main.lean", "name": "formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.idMat_mem_CoLipSetOn"},
